# Four-Person Manual Booking QA Plan — 55 Scenarios

## Purpose

This document divides a complete booking-process audit among four testers. Each tester owns a primary set of ten scenarios plus assigned extended edge cases and records defects in a section-specific bug table. Testing is sequential: only one tester runs at a time on that tester's own laptop and local XAMPP/MySQL installation. There is no host laptop or shared live database. The goal is to test booking creation through scheduling, payments, equipment release, return inspection, completion, notifications, reporting, audit history, and offline synchronization.

This is a manual browser test plan. Do not change application code while executing it. Use fictional data only.

## Read this first

You do not need to read all 55 scenarios before starting. Find your tester section, complete its scenarios from top to bottom, and fill in the result line immediately after each test.

